#ASSERT `Art 100 and 101 the last day on which I can file my appeal` `a cantonal enactment` `a decision of none of these kinds` FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) 0 EQUALS `the last day for filing is` (Date 1 7 2026)
#ASSERT `Art 100 and 101 the last day on which I can file my appeal` `an unlawful refusal or delay of a decision` `a decision of none of these kinds` FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) 0 EQUALS `the appeal can be brought at any time`
#ASSERT `Art 100 and 101 my appeal is in time` `a decision` `a decision of none of these kinds` FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) 0 (Date 31 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 100 and 101 my appeal is in time` `a decision` `a decision of none of these kinds` FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) 0 (Date 1 4 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 100 and 101 my appeal is in time` `a decision` `a decision of none of these kinds` FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) 0 (Date 28 2 2026) EQUALS NOTHING

